    "#### **<font color=\"ForestGreen\"> Jorge L. García Franco y Geraldine Solorio Zamora </font>**\n",
    "### Escuela Nacional de Ciencias de la Tierra\n",
    "#### Semestre 2027-I\n",
    "\n",
    "![LOGO_ENCIT.png](attachment:398ea254-5a51-4d41-b547-e7c65669aab9.png)\n",
